2026-07-27T09:32:03.6303935Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T09:32:03.6304713Z i /tmp/RtmptVwaBq/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:32:03.6305103Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:32:03.6305558Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:32:03.6305979Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:32:03.6306603Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:32:03.6307548Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:32:03.6308580Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
